1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 12)

3
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:54,719
All right.

4
00:01:57,239 --> 00:01:57,879
Xiao Ning,

5
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,560
be careful with your toys.

6
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:00,920
I'll be right over.

7
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,560
Xiao Ning.

8
00:02:04,719 --> 00:02:05,719
Yeah?

9
00:02:07,159 --> 00:02:08,159
Come here.

10
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:11,960
Come on.

11
00:02:14,639 --> 00:02:15,199
Xiao Ning,

12
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:17,159
Daddy has to go to a meeting in a bit.

13
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,360
Can you play by yourself
at home for a while?

14
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:21,279
Dad, you're going to another meeting.

15
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,638
You're leaving me all alone.

16
00:02:22,639 --> 00:02:24,400
I get so bored by myself.

17
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,039
Be a good boy.

18
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,240
How about Daddy

19
00:02:29,719 --> 00:02:31,096
finds someone to play with you, okay?

20
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,120
Okay!

21
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,240
See you next time.

22
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:48,319
Thank you.

23
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,319
Right, I got it.

24
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,695
Let's leave it at that for now.

25
00:02:59,719 --> 00:03:01,479
Push back whatever
projects you can for now.

26
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,735
I have someone important to see.

27
00:03:02,759 --> 00:03:04,679
Daddy, I dropped my ball.

28
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,318
My ball rolled away.

29
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:06,719
It's all right.

30
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:08,120
Daddy will buy you a new one.

31
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:37,599
Did your friend already leave, Daddy?

32
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,680
Good boy, Ji Ning.

33
00:03:45,599 --> 00:03:46,639
Daddy will play with you.

34
00:03:46,879 --> 00:03:49,039
The guest in this room
has already checked out.

35
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,839
What do we do now, Daddy?

36
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,319
Nobody's going to play with me.

37
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,000
My ball...

38
00:04:08,719 --> 00:04:09,719
Mr. Ji.

39
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,360
What's going on?

40
00:04:15,199 --> 00:04:16,519
I got the time wrong.

41
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:18,279
I thought today...

42
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,360
My ball!

43
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:23,920
Stay.

44
00:04:24,079 --> 00:04:25,079
All right.

45
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,240
Hooray!

46
00:04:26,241 --> 00:04:27,560
Someone's going to play with me!

47
00:04:30,319 --> 00:04:31,319
Say hello.

48
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:32,959
Hello, Uncle Shen.

49
00:04:34,519 --> 00:04:35,120
Hello there,

50
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,120
Xiao Ning.

51
00:04:39,319 --> 00:04:40,319
How is your hand?

52
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,199
It's almost completely healed.

53
00:04:50,079 --> 00:04:51,799
Remember to apply the ointment twice today.

54
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,279
Since you're staying,

55
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:56,240
what are your plans for today?

56
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:58,519
I'll probably paint inside during the day,

57
00:04:58,759 --> 00:05:00,599
and take a walk on the
beach in the afternoon.

58
00:05:00,959 --> 00:05:02,079
So you're free, then.

59
00:05:02,319 --> 00:05:03,319
I suppose so.

60
00:05:04,639 --> 00:05:05,639
Do me a favor.

61
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,120
Help me

62
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,480
look after Ji Ning.

63
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:12,040
Daddy doesn't want me anymore!

64
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:14,199
I have to meet a client today,

65
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,360
and I have to leave soon.

66
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:17,319
Ji Ning won't let go of me,

67
00:05:17,639 --> 00:05:18,879
insisting that I stay with him.

68
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:21,839
But I have no idea how
to take care of a child.

69
00:05:22,439 --> 00:05:23,519
The nanny is here.

70
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:25,079
Just stay close

71
00:05:25,439 --> 00:05:26,439
and keep an eye on him.

72
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,759
Uncle, play with me!

73
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,959
You're the only one I trust.

74
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:36,959
All right, then.

75
00:05:38,319 --> 00:05:39,359
Let's go over to my place.

76
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:41,439
I have everything set up there.

77
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,639
The nanny is around,

78
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:44,519
so just let her know if you need anything.

79
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:45,919
I'll be out at sea during the day

80
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,480
and should be back around dusk.

81
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:49,120
We can have dinner together then.

82
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:55,920
Call me if anything comes up.

83
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,519
Ji Ning knows my number.

84
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,680
Right, buddy?

85
00:05:58,720 --> 00:05:59,720
Of course!

86
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,920
Speak Chinese when talking to Uncle Shen.

87
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:04,079
Of course!

88
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:12,759
This looks just like a family of three.

89
00:06:14,759 --> 00:06:15,759
Mr. Ji.

90
00:06:16,079 --> 00:06:17,079
Sister Chen.

91
00:06:17,879 --> 00:06:19,360
This is an old friend of mine.

92
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,080
He's here to keep Ji Ning company.

93
00:06:22,319 --> 00:06:23,199
I have business to attend to,

94
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:24,319
so I'll head out now.

95
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,720
Don't worry, Mr. Ji. Go ahead
and take care of business.

96
00:06:28,639 --> 00:06:29,639
An old friend?

97
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,279
I suppose that's true.

98
00:06:33,879 --> 00:06:35,360
Ji Ning is normally quite spoiled

99
00:06:35,639 --> 00:06:36,800
and a bit willful.

100
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,040
Shen Mo,

101
00:06:38,041 --> 00:06:39,361
you don't have to go easy on him.

102
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:40,759
Really?

103
00:06:41,199 --> 00:06:42,479
He seems very well-behaved to me.

104
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,480
Yeah.

105
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,240
This is so awesome!

106
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:49,680
Yeah.

107
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:50,240
All right.

108
00:06:50,241 --> 00:06:51,319
Let's sanitize your hands.

109
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:54,839
Here.

110
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:55,839
The other hand, too.

111
00:06:58,319 --> 00:06:58,879
Good boy.

112
00:06:58,879 --> 00:06:59,879
Go on and play.

113
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,000
Be careful!

114
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:02,439
Look!

115
00:07:02,439 --> 00:07:03,439
A dragonfly!

116
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,600
By the way, Sister Chen,

117
00:07:15,519 --> 00:07:16,879
did Mrs. Ji not come along?

118
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:20,318
Mr. Ji is here on business,

119
00:07:20,319 --> 00:07:22,439
so he only brought the young master.

120
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:25,240
Uncle Shen, come quick!

121
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,040
Coming!

122
00:07:35,959 --> 00:07:37,920
Young Master, come try
the steamed egg custard.

123
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:42,920
You eat first, Uncle.

124
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:51,959
Daddy told me to take
good care of Uncle Shen.

125
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:59,013
You two really hit it off. He's never
this well-behaved with anyone else.

126
00:08:00,439 --> 00:08:02,600
Does Mr. Ji come to M Island often?

127
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,999
Well, since the hotel just opened,

128
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,758
Mr. Ji has been visiting
quite frequently lately.

129
00:08:06,759 --> 00:08:09,240
Mr. Ji cares deeply about this hotel.

130
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:11,680
He even named it himself.

131
00:08:12,519 --> 00:08:13,519
Seamo?

132
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:17,079
Could it mean "Missing Mo"?
[TN: "Thinking" of [Shen] "Mo"]

133
00:08:21,319 --> 00:08:22,600
Stop flattering yourself.

134
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:24,519
I'm full!

135
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:26,199
Let's go play, Uncle Shen!

136
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,000
No more playing for now.

137
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:30,519
It's naptime.

138
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:31,879
Aww...

139
00:08:32,279 --> 00:08:34,759
Why are you just like Daddy?

140
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,240
Come on.

141
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,240
Xiao Ning,

142
00:08:39,399 --> 00:08:41,440
how does your daddy usually tuck you in?

143
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,679
Pretty much like Uncle Shen does,

144
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:45,919
but also a little different.

145
00:08:47,279 --> 00:08:48,279
How is it different?

146
00:08:48,919 --> 00:08:50,319
He tells me stories,

147
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:53,039
and he always cuddles
me like this from this side.

148
00:08:53,679 --> 00:08:54,679
I see.

149
00:08:55,759 --> 00:08:58,558
I wish both of you would sleep next to me.

150
00:08:58,559 --> 00:08:59,480
One on each side.

151
00:08:59,481 --> 00:09:01,080
Then I could cuddle whoever I want.

152
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:03,559
In your dreams.

153
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:06,080
Hehe.

154
00:09:07,159 --> 00:09:10,519
Even though Daddy gives the
best hugs in the whole wide world,

155
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,919
Uncle Shen is really nice to cuddle, too.

156
00:09:13,039 --> 00:09:15,519
I really want Daddy to feel it, too.

157
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,840
You silly little rascal.

158
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:19,919
Go to sleep.

159
00:09:39,159 --> 00:09:40,159
Sister Chen.

160
00:09:40,279 --> 00:09:41,799
I didn't expect Ji Ning

161
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:43,240
to get so attached to you.

162
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,518
With anyone else,

163
00:09:44,519 --> 00:09:45,919
he's terribly shy around strangers.

164
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:49,399
This little guy and Ji Mingxuan
really are cut from the same cloth.

165
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:51,120
Maybe we just clicked.

166
00:09:52,159 --> 00:09:54,398
Mr. Ji must trust you immensely.

167
00:09:54,399 --> 00:09:58,062
He has never let an outsider
look after Ji Ning before.

168
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,720
Come to think of it,

169
00:10:02,559 --> 00:10:05,200
Mr. Ji and I have known
each other for years.

170
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:29,080
Daddy...

171
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:32,559
Uncle Shen!

172
00:10:32,639 --> 00:10:33,639
You're awake?

173
00:10:35,679 --> 00:10:38,840
Uncle Shen, I want to play games.

174
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,120
All right, all right.

175
00:10:41,121 --> 00:10:42,279
My little young master,

176
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,799
what game do you want to play?

177
00:10:45,759 --> 00:10:46,759
On the phone!

178
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:48,999
But Uncle doesn't have
any games on his phone.

179
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,360
Daddy's phone has them.

180
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,360
This is your daddy's phone?

181
00:10:56,679 --> 00:10:57,240
Yeah.

182
00:10:57,241 --> 00:10:58,279
Uncle, unlock it for me.

183
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:00,279
All right.

184
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:01,600
Only for a little while, okay?

185
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:02,960
Hurry, hurry!

186
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:07,399
Since when did your dad get so frugal?

187
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,200
Keeping such an ancient phone around.

188
00:11:10,159 --> 00:11:12,679
Daddy uses this phone all the time.

189
00:11:19,559 --> 00:11:20,759
Were you sitting right here,

190
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:22,919
watching Ji Ning play, too?

191
00:11:26,879 --> 00:11:28,000
Died again!

192
00:11:28,279 --> 00:11:29,320
I quit!

193
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,840
It's no fun at all.

194
00:11:31,639 --> 00:11:34,719
All right, that's enough. Kids shouldn't
stare at screens for too long anyway.

195
00:11:37,583 --> 00:11:39,189
[Messages]

196
00:11:43,483 --> 00:11:45,697
[To Shen Mo: Shen Mo, where
are you? Did you leave with Zhou Yang?]

197
00:11:45,721 --> 00:11:47,936
[Come Back. Shen Mo, don't
leave. Stay. Stay with me.]

198
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:03,759
Mr. Ji,

199
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:05,638
Zhou Yang, the one you
had me watch, made a move.

200
00:12:05,639 --> 00:12:06,639
Go on.

201
00:12:07,159 --> 00:12:08,480
He contacted Mr. Shen.

202
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:10,679
Something about taking him away.

203
00:12:14,559 --> 00:12:15,559
I know.

204
00:12:16,759 --> 00:12:17,960
Should I do anything?

205
00:12:20,799 --> 00:12:21,799
No need.

206
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:24,239
You don't need to keep an eye
on Zhou Yang anymore either.

207
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,240
Understood.

208
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:37,120
Looks like you really
enjoy drinking, Mr. Ji.

209
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,360
Let's drink some more.

210
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,519
Is something on your mind, Mr. Ji?

211
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,120
Why do you keep drinking?

212
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:18,840
Mingxuan,

213
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,840
you can talk to me about anything.

214
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,120
To me,

215
00:13:22,121 --> 00:13:23,919
you've never been just a business partner.

216
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:39,879
Mingxuan,

217
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:41,040
you've had too much to drink.

218
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,440
Let me take you home.

219
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,200
Home...

220
00:13:46,639 --> 00:13:47,639
Yes.

221
00:13:48,799 --> 00:13:49,799
I want to go home.

222
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:50,919
Come on.

223
00:13:50,919 --> 00:13:51,919
Let's go home.

224
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:56,200
You're not him.

225
00:13:57,559 --> 00:13:58,799
I want to go back to our home.

226
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,200
To Jinxiu Villa.

227
00:14:10,900 --> 00:14:12,900
Isn't Mr. Ji going home?

228
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:16,480
To Jinxiu Villa.

229
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,720
That's our real home.

230
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:24,919
I have to find him.

231
00:14:25,799 --> 00:14:26,879
I'll wait for him there.

232
00:14:35,559 --> 00:14:36,559
You're awake.

233
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:37,960
Give me your phone.

234
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:40,039
I'll call in sick for you.

235
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,720
Someone sent you a bunch of texts.

236
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:56,360
Do you want to see them?

237
00:14:56,519 --> 00:14:57,519
Delete them all.

238
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,560
Are you sure you want to delete them?

239
00:14:59,679 --> 00:15:00,679
Yes.

240
00:15:00,759 --> 00:15:01,960
Don't regret it later.

241
00:15:03,086 --> 00:15:04,429
[He's deleting the messages
he himself sent Shen Mo]

242
00:15:04,453 --> 00:15:06,252
I don't know why I said that.

243
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:09,240
Did I want him to see those messages?

244
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,320
I didn't know.

245
00:15:12,679 --> 00:15:13,959
If he really wanted to see them,

246
00:15:14,519 --> 00:15:15,919
would I have even dared to let him?

247
00:15:17,799 --> 00:15:18,840
Let it be, then.

248
00:15:19,519 --> 00:15:20,519
At least,

249
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,240
in this very moment,

250
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,720
you're still by my side.

251
00:15:25,559 --> 00:15:26,559
Shen Mo.

252
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:33,440
So...

253
00:15:33,799 --> 00:15:36,319
That's why he wanted to go to
Jinxiu Villa so badly that night.

254
00:15:36,799 --> 00:15:38,879
So these were the texts that were deleted.

255
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,919
What if I had seen those
messages back then?

256
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:44,720
What would have happened?

257
00:15:48,279 --> 00:15:49,839
Uncle Shen, what's wrong?

258
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,039
Are you crying?

259
00:15:52,759 --> 00:15:53,519
No.

260
00:15:53,519 --> 00:15:54,519
Uncle's not crying.

261
00:15:55,159 --> 00:15:56,759
Your eyes are all red.

262
00:15:56,799 --> 00:15:58,120
Why are you crying, Uncle?

263
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:03,240
Xiao Ning,

264
00:16:04,039 --> 00:16:05,319
can Uncle give you a hug?

265
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:05,799
Sure.

266
00:16:05,799 --> 00:16:06,799
Hug me, Uncle.

267
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:12,519
This child shares Ji Mingxuan's own blood.

268
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:19,399
Xiao Ning,

269
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,440
Yeah?

270
00:16:21,919 --> 00:16:23,038
Does your daddy love you?

271
00:16:23,039 --> 00:16:24,039
Yes!

272
00:16:26,679 --> 00:16:27,679
And...

273
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:30,639
does Daddy love Mommy, too?

274
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:31,960
Of course he does!

275
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:37,960
That's wonderful.

276
00:16:42,799 --> 00:16:43,440
Come on,

277
00:16:43,441 --> 00:16:44,761
let's go play in the living room.

278
00:16:44,799 --> 00:16:45,799
Let's go!

279
00:16:50,799 --> 00:16:51,879
Rooster.

280
00:16:51,956 --> 00:16:53,976
[They're playing some sort of homophonic
game where the "Ji" sound gets repeated]

281
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:03,320
Xiao Ning.

282
00:17:04,079 --> 00:17:05,079
Daddy!

283
00:17:06,759 --> 00:17:07,559
Xiao Ning,

284
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:08,680
were you a good boy today?

285
00:17:09,319 --> 00:17:10,039
Of course!

286
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:11,399
If you don't believe me, ask Uncle Shen.

287
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,400
Right?

288
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:15,000
Yes.

289
00:17:15,119 --> 00:17:16,599
Xiao Ning was very well-behaved.

290
00:17:17,319 --> 00:17:18,319
Yeah.

291
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:20,119
Thank you for looking after him.

292
00:17:20,559 --> 00:17:22,319
Since when did you
become so polite, Mr. Ji?

293
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:24,840
Let's have dinner together tonight.

294
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:27,200
Sure.

295
00:17:27,359 --> 00:17:28,519
What do you feel like eating?

296
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:30,519
Whatever you'd like, Mr. Ji.

297
00:17:32,279 --> 00:17:33,399
All these years have passed,

298
00:17:34,319 --> 00:17:35,519
and you haven't changed a bit.

299
00:17:36,079 --> 00:17:37,319
You're still the same as ever.

300
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:42,960
What about you?

301
00:17:46,359 --> 00:17:47,359
Some things have changed,

302
00:17:49,559 --> 00:17:50,640
and some haven't.

303
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:56,440
I wanted to take you out to dinner,

304
00:17:57,279 --> 00:17:59,480
but with Ji Ning around,

305
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,080
it's not very easy to go anywhere.

306
00:18:01,799 --> 00:18:03,200
That's how it is with kids.

307
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,440
Everything revolves around them.

308
00:18:06,119 --> 00:18:08,960
Why are we eating this here, too?

309
00:18:12,559 --> 00:18:14,279
Uncle Shen likes this food.

310
00:18:14,759 --> 00:18:15,759
Besides,

311
00:18:16,225 --> 00:18:18,745
you eat pasta and steak every day.

312
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:21,119
Aren't you tired of it yet?

313
00:18:21,799 --> 00:18:22,799
Fine.

314
00:18:28,039 --> 00:18:29,039
What if...

315
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:32,560
What if I had gone to Jinxiu
Villa with Ji Mingxuan that night?

316
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:34,760
How would things have turned out?

317
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:37,782
What if I had seen the
texts Ji Mingxuan sent me?

318
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:40,240
What if I hadn't fallen
for Zhou Chu's scheme?

319
00:18:42,519 --> 00:18:43,920
But there's no use in 'what-ifs.'

320
00:18:44,519 --> 00:18:45,519
What's in the past

321
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:46,920
is gone forever.

322
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:51,640
Thank you.

323
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:00,880
When are you leaving?

324
00:19:03,599 --> 00:19:04,599
Leaving?

325
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:06,480
To where?

326
00:19:08,359 --> 00:19:09,359
Back home.

327
00:19:10,079 --> 00:19:11,079
Oh.

328
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:12,440
I haven't decided yet.

329
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,279
What about you, Mr. Ji?

330
00:19:15,559 --> 00:19:16,559
Well,

331
00:19:18,759 --> 00:19:21,359
I still have some unfinished work,

332
00:19:21,839 --> 00:19:23,160
so it'll be a while longer.

333
00:19:25,079 --> 00:19:26,079
I see.

334
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:28,160
Yeah.

335
00:19:34,599 --> 00:19:35,599
Mr. Ji...

336
00:19:35,839 --> 00:19:36,839
Yes?

337
00:19:38,119 --> 00:19:39,119
Are...

338
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:41,640
Are you free tonight?

339
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:46,079
Aren't I free right now?

340
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:48,640
I mean after dinner.

341
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:51,360
There's nothing in particular.

342
00:19:51,839 --> 00:19:52,839
My biggest chore

343
00:19:53,519 --> 00:19:55,079
is just getting Ji Ning to sleep.

344
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:58,640
Then once Xiao Ning falls asleep,

345
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:03,400
could you give me an hour, Mr. Ji?

346
00:20:08,599 --> 00:20:09,839
Half an hour is enough.

347
00:20:12,039 --> 00:20:13,039
What is it?

348
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,759
I'd like to paint a
portrait of you, Mr. Ji.

349
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:22,079
It's what we promised before,

350
00:20:24,559 --> 00:20:25,559
remember?

351
00:20:28,839 --> 00:20:30,359
Once my hand heals,

352
00:20:31,200 --> 00:20:32,416
you'll be the first person I paint.

353
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:33,440
Would that be all right?

354
00:20:33,799 --> 00:20:34,799
All right.

355
00:20:37,839 --> 00:20:39,079
So you agree, Mr. Ji?

356
00:20:40,799 --> 00:20:41,799
Of course.

357
00:20:44,079 --> 00:20:45,079
This time,

358
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:47,440
I won't let myself have any regrets.

359
00:20:52,359 --> 00:20:53,119
Daddy,

360
00:20:53,120 --> 00:20:54,240
I'm so sleepy.

361
00:20:57,279 --> 00:20:58,759
Let's head back now,

362
00:20:59,279 --> 00:21:00,279
okay?

363
00:21:01,319 --> 00:21:02,319
Okay.

364
00:21:04,599 --> 00:21:06,400
Once I put Ji Ning to sleep,

365
00:21:07,079 --> 00:21:08,319
I'll come over to your room.

366
00:21:09,759 --> 00:21:10,440
Sure.

367
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:11,440
Take your time.

368
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:12,720
Okay.

369
00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:32,359
Weren't you sleepy?

370
00:21:34,440 --> 00:21:35,079
Come on,

371
00:21:35,080 --> 00:21:36,679
tell me a story.

372
00:21:36,680 --> 00:21:39,000
I want the Big Bad Wolf
and Little White Rabbit story.

373
00:21:40,160 --> 00:21:41,680
That one again?

374
00:21:41,880 --> 00:21:43,759
We've gone over that one so many times.

375
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,119
Let's pick another one.

376
00:21:45,599 --> 00:21:46,719
No, no!

377
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:48,160
I want that one!

378
00:21:51,760 --> 00:21:53,080
I really can't say no to you.

379
00:21:54,279 --> 00:21:55,279
Once upon a time,

380
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:57,880
there was a big bad wolf

381
00:21:58,240 --> 00:21:59,559
and a little white rabbit.

382
00:22:38,759 --> 00:22:39,640
God, Shen Mo,

383
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:40,640
what are you doing?

384
00:22:42,799 --> 00:22:44,359
It's not like you're going on a date.

385
00:22:46,799 --> 00:22:47,799
And in the end,

386
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:50,519
the big bad wolf and the little
white rabbit became best friends

387
00:22:51,119 --> 00:22:52,880
and lived happily ever after.

388
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:53,960
Huh?

389
00:22:53,961 --> 00:22:56,640
That's not how it went last time.

390
00:22:58,519 --> 00:23:00,160
That's exactly how it went.

391
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:02,680
Xiao Ning...

392
00:23:03,799 --> 00:23:05,599
the big bad wolf and
the little white rabbit

393
00:23:06,039 --> 00:23:08,279
will live together happily forever.

394
00:23:09,240 --> 00:23:10,240
All right,

395
00:23:11,519 --> 00:23:12,519
go to sleep.

396
00:23:12,759 --> 00:23:13,759
Okay.

397
00:24:17,920 --> 00:24:19,319
I'm sorry, Mr. Ji.

398
00:24:20,160 --> 00:24:21,880
I might be taking up some of your time.

399
00:24:22,559 --> 00:24:23,559
It's fine.

400
00:24:24,119 --> 00:24:25,439
I have all the time in the world.

401
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:27,200
Half an hour will be enough.

402
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:31,200
Should I pose in a certain way?

403
00:24:32,599 --> 00:24:33,599
Whatever feels natural.

404
00:24:43,599 --> 00:24:45,319
When did your hand get better?

405
00:24:47,119 --> 00:24:48,119
It never did.

406
00:24:48,799 --> 00:24:50,599
I've switched to painting
with my left hand.

407
00:24:51,640 --> 00:24:53,200
The injury should have healed long ago.

408
00:24:56,079 --> 00:24:57,079
Yes.

409
00:24:58,119 --> 00:24:59,720
The doctor said it's psychological.

410
00:25:02,799 --> 00:25:04,039
That makes it trickier.

411
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:06,480
It's something only you yourself can overcome.

412
00:25:07,279 --> 00:25:09,559
No one else can help with that.

413
00:25:40,039 --> 00:25:41,359
If it still hurts,

414
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:42,920
just use your left hand.

415
00:25:44,279 --> 00:25:45,279
It's okay.

416
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:47,720
I want to try.

417
00:25:48,559 --> 00:25:49,559
All right.

418
00:25:57,839 --> 00:25:58,839
Don't be afraid.

419
00:25:59,119 --> 00:26:00,279
You'll be fine.

420
00:26:00,599 --> 00:26:01,839
No matter what happens,

421
00:26:02,960 --> 00:26:04,240
I'll be right here with you.

422
00:26:16,599 --> 00:26:18,160
If anyone can heal me,

423
00:26:18,960 --> 00:26:20,519
it could only be you,

424
00:26:21,519 --> 00:26:22,519
Ji Mingxuan.

425
00:26:26,920 --> 00:26:27,920
Can you manage?

426
00:26:28,920 --> 00:26:29,920
I don't know.

427
00:26:30,720 --> 00:26:31,720
I believe in you.

428
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:46,839
Weren't you going to paint?

429
00:26:47,240 --> 00:26:48,240
That's right.

430
00:26:49,079 --> 00:26:50,079
Mr. Ji,

431
00:26:51,079 --> 00:26:52,079
don't move.

432
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:53,480
Shen Mo...

433
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:56,359
This paint washes off after a night.

434
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:58,535
I'll be leaving first
thing tomorrow morning,

435
00:26:58,559 --> 00:27:00,119
and I won't appear in your life again.

436
00:27:04,400 --> 00:27:05,400
Just for tonight.

437
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:09,160
Just this once.

438
00:27:12,640 --> 00:27:14,079
Let me finish this painting.

439
00:27:17,640 --> 00:27:18,839
I've heard people say

440
00:27:20,759 --> 00:27:22,119
the reason a wedding ring

441
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:23,920
is worn on the left hand

442
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:27,000
is because it's closer to the heart.

443
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:30,400
I once lost something
very important that someone gave me.

444
00:27:32,960 --> 00:27:33,960
And now,

445
00:27:34,680 --> 00:27:35,759
I want to return it

446
00:27:37,720 --> 00:27:39,640
to where it always belonged.

447
00:27:45,640 --> 00:27:46,640
Mr. Ji,

448
00:27:48,440 --> 00:27:49,640
my heart is right here.

449
00:27:52,079 --> 00:27:53,279
Ever since seven years ago,

450
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:56,880
it has always been right here.

451
00:27:59,480 --> 00:28:00,920
On that rainy night seven years ago,

452
00:28:01,680 --> 00:28:02,319
Ji Mingxuan

453
00:28:02,640 --> 00:28:04,359
placed his heart into my hands,

454
00:28:05,319 --> 00:28:06,920
yet never received an answer.

455
00:28:07,759 --> 00:28:08,759
Seven years later,

456
00:28:09,519 --> 00:28:10,839
I just want Mr. Ji

457
00:28:11,039 --> 00:28:12,480
to see my heart as well.

458
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:20,119
It hasn't even been half an hour.

459
00:28:20,960 --> 00:28:22,079
Let me wipe it off for you.

460
00:28:25,519 --> 00:28:26,920
Is this really enough?

461
00:28:28,000 --> 00:28:29,720
You don't want to paint a portrait anymore?

462
00:28:31,079 --> 00:28:32,079
There's no need.

463
00:28:32,559 --> 00:28:35,023
Not everything
can be captured with a brush.

464
00:28:44,720 --> 00:28:45,759
I'll wipe it myself.

465
00:29:06,720 --> 00:29:08,400
What are your plans once you return home?

466
00:29:11,440 --> 00:29:12,880
Keep painting, of course.

467
00:29:16,160 --> 00:29:17,480
No plans to get married?

468
00:29:24,039 --> 00:29:25,599
I haven't met the right person yet.

469
00:29:32,559 --> 00:29:34,480
Then what kind of person is right for you?

470
00:29:35,440 --> 00:29:36,440
Well...

471
00:29:37,119 --> 00:29:38,559
What kind of person?

472
00:29:40,640 --> 00:29:41,720
I don't really know either.

473
00:29:41,960 --> 00:29:42,960
Maybe...

474
00:29:44,440 --> 00:29:45,479
someone with shared interests,

475
00:29:45,480 --> 00:29:46,640
someone I can talk to.

476
00:29:51,119 --> 00:29:52,640
The Shen Mo I knew

477
00:29:54,680 --> 00:29:56,119
didn't seem to be like that.

478
00:29:56,359 --> 00:29:57,359
What do you mean?

479
00:29:58,119 --> 00:29:59,759
The Shen Mo I knew

480
00:30:01,839 --> 00:30:03,559
had very high standards.

481
00:30:12,079 --> 00:30:13,079
Do you think...

482
00:30:13,440 --> 00:30:14,960
I'm worthy of Mr. Shen?
